# Print-specific overrides. Build.ps1 merges these on top of content.env.
PAGE_TITLE=Georgios Feidakis CV
CV_FILENAME=https://geofeid.github.io/Online_CV/
CV_DOWNLOAD_NAME=Georgios_Feidakis_Online_CV
CV_LABEL=Online CV

ABOUT_PARAGRAPH=Senior Software Engineer specialising in Angular, TypeScript and modern front-end architecture, with React / Next.js on freelance work. Comfortable across the stack — .NET BFF, Node.js, REST APIs, SQL — and shipping through Azure DevOps, Jenkins and Docker. Five years on enterprise platforms in banking, government and retail.

EXP1_DESC=Refactored a legacy ASPX banking system into a modern Angular UI. Led an Angular insurance sales platform through to stable production, working with stakeholders and backend teams. Code reviews, frontend standards and mentoring junior developers.

EXP2_DESC=Angular platforms across travel authorization, ticketing, eCommerce, government and fuel management. Reusable templated frontends with custom components and integrated REST APIs. Led the EuroElections 2024 upgrade from Angular 7 to 18 with Angular Signals. NgRx state, responsive design, Jenkins, Docker and CI/CD.

EXP3_DESC=Modernising a large-scale eBanking platform, migrating legacy AngularJS to the latest Angular. Complex banking workflows across payments, transfers, approvals and multi-step transactional journeys. Figma designs turned into responsive, production-ready interfaces. .NET BFF integrations, unit testing and Azure DevOps pipelines.

